Feature: Assumption Defence
  As an architecture team lead
  I want the system to detect unstated assumptions, surface them in a structured output, and let me confirm or reject them before final delivery
  So that architecture generation is grounded in explicit decisions rather than silently-filled specification gaps

  Background:
    Given the adversarial cooperation system is configured with weighted evaluation
    And the criteria definitions include the UNSTATED_ASSUMPTION detection pattern
    And the Coach agent has UNSTATED_ASSUMPTION detection instructions in its system prompt
    And the Player agent has assumption-listing instructions in its system prompt

